# A Mox Diamond that entered by discarding a Forest (accepting, choosing it) taps for one mana of any colour (CR 106.1b): red here.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Diamond
Island
Forest
Island x17

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Island.Play
Bot1.Hand.Mox Diamond.Cast
Bot1.Accept
Bot1.Choose(Forest)
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Diamond.Activate(Color: Red)
? Bot1.Mana = {R}

[Expect]
Bot1.Mana = {R}
Bot1.Graveyard = Forest
